"Set your FPS cap to a custom amount, up to 500+ FPS!\n"
"0 disables your framerate cap altogether, however your\n"
"game might run unstable because of this.\n"
"Framerates below 60 will lead to buggier physics and\n"
"potentially easier gameplay, so scores with them will\n"
"not count because of this; but they're still there for laughs.\n"
"\n"
"You must disable Vertical Sync before using this!"
